nly 5 cards, we\'re in an emergency situation. I must play aggressively to either win control or force the landlord to expend their high cards. Playing ♦A (the highest single in my hand) maximizes pressure on the landlord. If they can\'t beat it, my teammate gets a free play with 13 cards. If they use a 2 or passed joker to beat it, that\'s one less bomb/control card for their endgame. This gives our peasant team the best chance to prevent the landlord from escaping.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♦A"]}'}
